# One process, sixteen commands, two ticks, two screenshots.
#
# This is the property the probe exists for. Testing this project used to be a process
# launch, one screenshot and a guess per question; here one launch advances the world
# four seconds, photographs two different moments from two different cameras, and prints
# the world census in between. A fifty-command script costs the same one launch.
#
#   MiVic.Game.exe --probe tools/probe/batch.probe --probe-out artifacts/probe/batch.txt

tick 60
zoom 260
pitch -0.72
yaw 0.62
focus 0 0
settle

# What the first frame holds, counted after rendering it.
visible
shot artifacts/probe/batch-a.png

# Ninety ticks later — four and a half seconds of battle — from a different camera.
tick 90
focus -60 40
settle
events 4
units soviet 3
surfaces
shot artifacts/probe/batch-b.png

expect "the world advanced 150 ticks" 150 150
